        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "NOTE 7 When ECDHCurve is set to \"SECP521\", the DHPublicKey is 133 bytes long. When ECDHCurve is set to \"X448\", the DHPublicKey is 57 bytes long.",
